      "writtenOn": "2024-11-15T16:38:33Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The way I worded the spec, the extension adds the ability to use the builtin functions and values. So in a way the diagnostic is being added to the core language. Maybe it should have a language feature, but that seems to overdo it. Definitely not an error to use without the enable. At best a warning, but maybe \"hey this won\u0027t do anything\" sort of warning.",
